<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank details March share issues, net inflows.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank details March share issues, net inflows.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following data for share issues and net inflows into investment funds in March (in billions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>				    March	 Feb	 March 96</p>
<p>SHARE ISSUES</p>
<p>    -at nominal value	 0.4	   0.2	  0.2</p>
<p>    -at issue price value   2.0	   0.7	  1.0</p>
<p>Net inflows into investment funds</p>
<p>    Total			10.2	  15.7	   6.0</p>
<p>    -Money market funds    -0.9	   0.1	  -0.3</p>
<p>    -bond-based funds	 0.1	   1.7	   0.9</p>
<p>    -share-based funds	2.6	   3.5	  -0.4</p>
<p>    -mixed funds		0.1	   0.2	   0.1</p>
<p>    -real estate funds	0.7	   1.2	   1.0</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
